<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — Corinathoth creature port.
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `Corinathoth` ThingDef/PawnKindDef
  pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml, workshop folder 3497316713), renamed under the
  RSW_ tier prefix. Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim. No custom body:
  `body` stays the vanilla Core `QuadrupedAnimalWithHoovesAndHorn` — no
  BodyDef port needed. `leatherDef`/`specificMeatDef` repoint to the
  already-ported RSW_Leather_Tough (Borcatu, Wave C pass 3) and
  RSW_Pachydermoid_Meat (Iriaz/Mudhorn, Wave C pass 1) — no new resource
  needed. No comps (no egg layer), no custom ability. Sounds repoint to the
  already-absorbed sound wave (RSW_Pawn_Corinathoth_*, 2026-09-02). texPaths
  are unchanged text — extracted art sits at
  Textures/swanimals/Corinathoth/ (extract_bundle.py against the same
  AssetBundle every prior wave used; 3 extra "CorinathothPack" textures in
  the bundle are unreferenced by any donor def, left unextracted).

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: AridShrubland (per
  cast_assignment.csv's current row for this species), repointed from the
  bare "Corinathoth" entry in cast_assignment.csv / BiomeCast_Ashkarr.xml.
-->
<Defs>
<ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Corinathoth</defName>
    <label>corinathoth</label>
    <description>Corinathoths were large, slow-moving herbivores native to the planet Maridun. Although large and intimidating, they were fairly harmless unless provoked. It is likely they were spread as a large game animal to several worlds due to their fearsome appearance.</description>
